# 🧠 15. COMPLEXITY MASTER REVISION

You should know these instantly:

| Algorithm / Structure  |            Typical complexity |
| ---------------------- | ----------------------------: |
| Array access           |                          O(1) |
| HashMap lookup         |                  O(1) average |
| HashSet lookup         |                  O(1) average |
| Binary Search          |                      O(log n) |
| Sorting                |                    O(n log n) |
| BFS                    |                      O(V + E) |
| DFS                    |                      O(V + E) |
| Heap insertion         |                      O(log n) |
| Heap removal           |                      O(log n) |
| Dijkstra + binary heap |                O((V+E) log V) |
| DP                     | Depends on states/transitions |
| Backtracking           |             Often exponential |

